# Patches must stay LF: they are applied by GNU patch inside the Linux
# build tree, and CRLF line endings make context matching fail.
*.patch text eol=lf

# Everything else is consumed by BusyBox/Linux/U-Boot as-is. A CRLF checkout
# (Windows) breaks overlay script shebangs, inittab, kconfig fragments and
# boot.cmd, so pin every text file to LF on all platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf
